operator: Howdy, Gardener.
operator: You know the drill by now.
operator: There's a seed vault behind this door.
operator: So pop that sucker open, and we get to look at the goodies together after.
operator: In the meantime, would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
	operator: Saving progress...
	[signal arg="save_signal"]
	operator: Save complete.
	jump save_done
- No
	operator: Roger dodger! I'll be here if you need to save progress in the future.
	jump save_done
label save_done
operator: At that, I wish you the best of luck, Gardener.
operator: See you on the flip side!
[signal arg="scene_end_op"]
[end_timeline]